     "title": "Dream Machine: the surreal power and prescience of Satoshi Kon’s Paprika at 20",
     "link": "https://letterboxd.com/journal/satoshi-kon-paprika-deep-impact/",
     "time": "2026-11-26T03:59:16+13:00",
     "img": "https://a.ltrbxd.com/resized/sm/upload/bz/qi/t2/d2/v9NtFbWXptTNjuISaIYObP6zc5H-0-960-0-540-crop-fill.jpg?k=c08dc9d360",
     "intro": "In celebration of Paprika’s twentieth anniversary, Kambole Campbell looks back at the subjectivity of dreams, cinema and the internet in the final feature by animation maestro Satoshi Kon.",
     "category": "Deep Impact"
